#####################################################
Version 1.2.4 - Development (unreleased)

  Maintenance:
   * Fixed undefined table prefix and plugin globals when Geeklog loads the plugin on enable.
   * Removed PostgreSQL support; MySQL only.
   * Fixed retention unit conversion and removal of orphaned search phrases.
   * Prevented GET-based log clearing and added CSRF verification.
   * Escaped public search query title attribute.
   * Added GitHub Actions PHP lint and distribution packaging.

  Warning: Data from PostgreSQL installations are not migrated automatically.

#####################################################
Version 1.2.3 - 03-June-2022

  New features:
   * Works with PHP v8.1
   
  New translations:
	* Persian
   
#####################################################
Version 1.2.1 - 17-December-2017

  New features:
   * Updated to work with Geeklog 2.1.3 and newer

